---
{
  title: "flatten"
}
---
### NAME

    flatten() - Flattens a nested array into a single-level array.

### SYNOPSIS

    mixed *flatten( mixed *arr );

### DESCRIPTION

    Flattens a nested array into a single-level array.

### PARAMETERS

    arr  (mixed*)
         Array to flatten

### RETURN VALUES

    (mixed*) Flattened array

### ERRORS

    If argument is not an array
